tatus="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ONODERA SYORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SASAKI MASAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAUCHI, SHOROKU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ONODERA, SYORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASAKI, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An activated sludge mixture liquid is directly extracted from a reaction tank (1) and dehydrated by a multiple-disk type dehydrator (9). The extracting operation for the activated sludge mixture liquid is performed by controlling the operation of a pump (P2) so that an SRT in the reaction tank (1) is maintained at a preset value. In addition, nitrifying and denitrifying is performed with an ASRT controlled to be constant by adjusting a substantial aerobic time ratio.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un liquide à mélange de boue activée est extrait directement d'un réservoir de réaction (1) et déshydraté par un déshydrateur (9) du type à disques multiples. L'opération d'extraction du liquide à mélange de boue activée est exécuté par commande du fonctionnement d'une pompe (P2) de manière à maintenir à une valeur prédéterminée un temps de séjour de la boue SRT dans le réservoir de réaction (1). De plus on procède à une nitrification et à une dénitrification avec un ASRT régulé pour être constant par ajustement d'un rapport de temps aérobie substantiel.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>